{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000ca55","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a182c3-02b1-7b00-b777-e99423afebca"},"sequence":901,"recorded_at":1780531400001797,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"01a182c3-0455-7441-a92b-48bae0d92ab9","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"command_id":"01a182c3-0455-7441-a92b-48bae0d92ab9","event":{"chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 321-325\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-A Redis lock per key returns `pending` to concurrent requests. Quota is\n-5 new images per person per day by hashed IP and signed cookie,\n-whichever runs out first; a shared spend counter in integer\n-micro-dollars sits under `SPEND_CAP_USD` (default 10). Failures refund\n-quota and budget and release the lock.\n+A Redis lock per key returns `pending` to concurrent requests. Quota is\n+5 new images per person per day by hashed IP and signed cookie,\n+whichever runs out first; a shared spend counter in integer\n+micro-dollars sits under `SPEND_CAP_USD` (default 10), plus a daily\n+spend counter per UTC day under `DAILY_SPEND_CAP_USD` (default 1.5).\n+The daily key carries a 48 h TTL and resets on UTC day rollover with\n+quota. Failures refund quota and both spend counters and release the\n+lock. Both caps apply only to requests paid with our key; a future\n+bring-your-own-key path skips them.\n","final_result":true,"kind":"output","task_id":"01a182c5-1460-7791-9d55-81d278ea2d8c"},"kind":"task_lifecycle","run_stream":{"id":"01a182c3-0455-7441-a92b-48bae0d92ab9","kind":"run"},"task_id":"01a182c5-1460-7791-9d55-81d278ea2d8c","task_stream":{"id":"01a182c5-1460-7791-9d55-81d278ea2d8c","kind":"task"}}}
