{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000ce09","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a182c3-02b1-7b00-b777-e99423afebca"},"sequence":1375,"recorded_at":1780531400002745,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"01a182c3-0455-7441-a92b-48bae0d92ab9","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"command_id":"01a182c3-0455-7441-a92b-48bae0d92ab9","kind":"run_terminal","reason":null,"run_stream":{"id":"01a182c3-0455-7441-a92b-48bae0d92ab9","kind":"run"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Done. Committed as `c82293a` on `daily-cap` with the requested message and trailer.\n\nWhat changed (8 files, all inside the allowed scope):\n\n- [server/images/env.ts](/workspace/wt-daily/server/images/env.ts): new optional `DAILY_SPEND_CAP_USD`, default 1.5 when unset, non-finite, or negative, exposed as `dailySpendCapMicro` on `ImageEnv`.\n- [core/images.ts](/workspace/wt-daily/core/images.ts): `MSG_BUDGET` replaced by `MSG_BUDGET_TOTAL` and `MSG_BUDGET_DAILY` with the two warm messages; new `dailySpendKey(day)` (UTC-day documented) and `DAILY_SPEND_TTL_SEC = 172800`.\n- [core/types.ts](/workspace/wt-daily/core/types.ts): `\"daily_budget\"` added to `ImageErrorCode`.\n- [server/images/orchestrate.ts](/workspace/wt-daily/server/images/orchestrate.ts): after the total-spend reserve passes, `INCRBY` on the daily key by `imageCostMicro()`, `EXPIRE` every time, and `daily_budget` + refund of daily, total, and quota + lock release when over the daily cap. A `refundDailySpendOnce` helper covers generate/store failures and the outer catch exactly once; cached hits still touch nothing. Short BYOK comment notes the caps are our-key-only and a future BYOK path must skip them.\n- Tests: 6 new cases in `orchestrate.test.ts` (under cap, over cap with refund/no-generate, UTC-day reset, total cap still `budget`, generate-failure refund, cached hit), 3 env cases, 1 core key/TTL case.\n- [docs/contracts.md](/workspace/wt-daily/docs/contracts.md): `daily_budget` code, env var default, UTC day, 48 h TTL, both messages, our-key-only note.\n\nVerification: `npx vitest run` 32 files / 310 tests pass, `npx tsc --noEmit` clean. No `lint` script exists, so nothing to run there. One note: the pre-commit size hook rejected the first commit attempt because the contracts edit pushed the file just over its 20 KB limit; I tightened only my own added sentences (all required content kept verbatim) to 19,945 bytes and it committed cleanly."}}
